## Flags for the installed binary's VM (ADR-0036). Burrito's launcher already passes
## -noshell; these are what `Geex.run/1`'s `--erl` flags add under `mix run`.

## Keep the Erlang shell's input driver off stdin, so `:prim_tty` owns the terminal.
-noinput

## Disable the break handler, so Ctrl-C reaches the keymap as a key instead of opening
## the BEAM's BREAK menu.
+Bd
